:"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210506005:1":{"text":"あー……誤解なんだって。あんたらが乗ってきた船に、海のギャングの旗があったろ？砂浜で初めて会ったときにそれが見えてさ……","source_cn":"唉……这是个误会，你们来锈锚港的船上不是有个水鬼的旗帜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57337CD2005AC17A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210506006:1":{"text":"旗って……あの爪だか骨だかよく分からないマークのついた旗のことですか！？","source_cn":"就是那个有点像……爪子又有点像……骨头的旗子？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B0D7D5F2D534925","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210506007:1":{"text":"海のギャングの船に乗ってる者はもれなくギャングの一味……それがブラッディ・マリーの判断だ。情報を提供すれば、街を守ることにも繋がるし、ちょっとした褒美ももらえる……","source_cn":"坐着水鬼帮的船，就是水鬼帮的人——在血薇帮的判断里，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74970EF9BE11C56A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210506008:1":{"text":"とんでもない誤解です！あれはもともと捨てられていた船なんですよ！","source_cn":"这是个大误会，那艘船我们是捡到的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74750FE2C661BB5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1210506008":{"text":"とんでもない誤解です！あれはもともと捨てられていた船なんですよ！","source_cn":"这是个大误会，那艘船我们是捡到的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74750FE2C661BB5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","do